The deployment failure is caused by custom metadata XML files missing required XML namespaces/declarations or having misconfigured metadata relationships. In Salesforce DX, the `<values>` fields on custom metadata records must be configured correctly, and the `<label>` tag must be present alongside standard metadata elements. Additionally, for metadata relationship fields like `Before_Insert__c` (which references `sObject_Trigger_Setting__mdt`), standard metadata structure requires the value to reference the API name of the target record. Since TAF has an `sObject_Trigger_Setting__mdt` record named `Contact`, referencing `"Contact"` is correct.

